---
/* ============================================================
   Terms of Use
   ------------------------------------------------------------
   Covers use of the website itself. The most important clause for
   a developer's site is §3: renders, plans, dimensions and figures
   on this site are indicative and are NOT an offer or a contract —
   the agreement for sale governs. Do not soften that section.

   IMPORTANT: this was drafted to be accurate to what the site
   actually does — it is not legal advice and has not been
   reviewed by a lawyer. Have it checked before relying on it.
   The registered office address and CIN, if you want them shown,
   still need filling in.
   ============================================================ */
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import { brand, contact } from "../data/site";

const lastUpdated = "28 July 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use — Nesting Tree"
  description="The terms on which Nesting Tree makes this website and its project information available."
>
  <SiteHeader />

  <main class="bg-stone">
    <!-- ===== Header ===== -->
    <section class="bg-ink text-stone pt-36 pb-16 lg:pt-44 lg:pb-20">
      <div class="max-w-[900px] mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-12">
        <span class="font-display text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-olive-100"
          >Legal</span
        >
        <h1
          class="font-display font-black text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl tracking-tight mt-4 leading-[1.05] text-white"
        >
          Terms of Use
        </h1>
        <p class="text-stone/60 text-sm mt-6">Last updated {lastUpdated}</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== Body ===== -->
    <section class="py-16 lg:py-24">
      <div class="max-w-[900px] mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-12 legal">
        <p class="lead">
          These terms govern your use of <strong>nestingtree.in</strong>. By browsing the site or
          submitting an enquiry, you accept them. If you do not agree with them, please do not use
          the site.
        </p>

        <h2>1. About this site</h2>
        <p>
          This website is published by {brand.name}, a residential developer operating in {
            brand.region
          }. It exists to describe our residences and to let you enquire about them.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Enquiries</h2>
        <p>
          When you submit an enquiry you confirm the details you have given are your own and are
          accurate, and you consent to us contacting you about the residence you asked about. How we
          handle those details is set out in our{" "}
          <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>. Submitting an enquiry creates no obligation on
          either side — it does not reserve, book or allot a home.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Project information is indicative</h2>
        <p>
          This is the most important thing on this page, so it is stated plainly:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            Elevations, renders, walkthroughs and interior images are <strong>artistic
            impressions</strong>, not photographs of a finished building, unless expressly captioned
            as site photography.
          </li>
          <li>
            Floor plans, layouts, dimensions, carpet areas and unit counts are{" "}
            <strong>indicative and not to scale</strong>, and may change during construction or on
            the direction of the sanctioning authority.
          </li>
          <li>
            Specifications, amenities, finishes and possession timelines are our current intent and
            may be varied.
          </li>
          <li>
            Nothing on this site is an offer, an invitation to offer, or a contract of any kind.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          The sale of any home is governed solely by the registered Agreement for Sale and the
          approved plans and sanctions applicable to that project. Where those documents and this
          website differ, <strong>those documents prevail</strong>. Please verify all details with
          our sales team before making a purchase decision or any payment.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Regulatory status</h2>
        <p>
          Not every project shown here is registered under MahaRERA. Where a project is registered,
          its registration number is shown on that project's own page; where it is not, the
          approvals it does hold are stated instead. Please check the status of the specific project
          you are interested in, and verify it on the MahaRERA portal, rather than assuming it from
          any other project on this site.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>
          The {brand.name} name and logo, and the text, renders, plans, photographs and design of
          this site, belong to us or are used with permission. You may view and print pages for your
          own reference in considering a purchase. You may not copy, republish or use them
          commercially without our written permission.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Acceptable use</h2>
        <p>
          Please do not attempt to disrupt or gain unauthorised access to this site or the systems
          behind it, submit false enquiries or another person's details, or use the site to send
          unlawful or abusive content.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Third-party links</h2>
        <p>
          Some pages link to third-party services such as Google Maps. We do not control those
          services and are not responsible for their content or their privacy practices.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Availability and liability</h2>
        <p>
          We try to keep this site accurate and available, but we do not guarantee it will be
          uninterrupted or error-free. To the extent permitted by law, we are not liable for indirect
          or consequential loss arising from your use of this site or from reliance on information
          published on it. Nothing here limits any liability that cannot lawfully be limited,
          including our obligations to allottees under applicable real-estate law.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Changes</h2>
        <p>
          We may update these terms or the content of the site at any time. The date at the top of
          this page shows when these terms were last changed.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Governing law</h2>
        <p>
          These terms are governed by the laws of India. The courts at Panvel, Navi Mumbai,
          Maharashtra have exclusive jurisdiction over any dispute arising from them.
        </p>

        <h2>11. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          {brand.name}<br />
          {contact.address}<br />
          <a href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}>{contact.email}</a> ·{" "}
          <a href={`tel:${contact.phone.replace(/\s/g, "")}`}>{contact.phone}</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== Footer bar ===== -->
    <footer class="bg-ink text-stone">
      <div class="max-w-[900px] mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-12 py-8">
        <div
          class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-stone/40"
        >
          <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} {brand.name}. All rights reserved.</p>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-5">
            <a href="/" class="hover:text-stone/70 transition-colors">Home</a>
            <a href="/privacy" class="hover:text-stone/70 transition-colors">Privacy Policy</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal :global(.lead) {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-ink, #1c1c1a);
  }
  .legal :global(h2) {
    font-family: Archivo, system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    margin-top: 2.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }
  .legal :global(p),
  .legal :global(li) {
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #55554f;
  }
  .legal :global(p) {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .legal :global(ul) {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 1.35rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .legal :global(li) {
    margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
  }
  .legal :global(strong) {
    color: #1c1c1a;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .legal :global(a) {
    color: #5c6b3c;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .legal :global(a:hover) {
    color: #3f4a29;
  }
</style>
